<title>POLAND: Amerbank shareholders approve new issue.</title>
<headline>Amerbank shareholders approve new issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Amerbank SA shareholders approved the 500,000 to 1,500,000-share ex-rights issue, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Earlier the bank said it would issue 1.2 million shares.</p>
<p>It said the price of the new shares will be determined by the bank's management.</p>
<p>Amerbank earlier said the executive board would decide whether or not to offer the shares to a chosen foreign bank, an international financial institution, or both.</p>
<p>The bank currently has 2.7 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
